{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">ACCUM function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/308801","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/ACCUM-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/ACCUM-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"ACCUM-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">ACCUM function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"ACCUM-function__section_N1002D_N1002A_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns the value of an aggregate expression that is calculated by an\n          <code class=\"ph codeph\">ACCUMULATE</code> or aggregate phrase of a <code class=\"ph codeph\">DISPLAY</code>\n        statement.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"ACCUM-function__syntax_GC152Y2679270\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d101926e107\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"ACCUM-function__idGDE1VU2661847\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>ACCUM <var class=\"keyword varname\">aggregate-phrase</var> <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">aggregate-phrase</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A phrase that identifies the aggregate value it should return.\nThis is the syntax for <var class=\"keyword varname\">aggregate-phrase</var>:<table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"ACCUM-function__idGDE1VW2661853\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\"><tr class=\"row rowsep-0\"><td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\"><pre class=\"pre codeblock OE\"><code><strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">{</strong> AVERAGE <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">|</strong> COUNT <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">|</strong> MAXIMUM <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">|</strong> MINIMUM <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">|</strong> TOTAL <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">|</strong> SUB-AVERAGE\n <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">|</strong> SUB-COUNT <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">|</strong> SUB-MAXIMUM <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">|</strong> SUB-MINIMUM <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">|</strong> SUB-TOTAL <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">}</strong>\n <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> BY <var class=\"keyword varname\">break-group</var><strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong></code></pre></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"p\">For more information on aggregate items, see\nthe <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Aggregate-phrase.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Aggregate-phrase.html\">Aggregate phrase</a> reference\nentry.</p></dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An expression that was used in an earlier <code class=\"ph codeph\">ACCUMULATE</code>\n            or <code class=\"ph codeph\">DISPLAY</code> statement. The expression you use in the\n              <code class=\"ph codeph\">ACCUMULATE</code> or <code class=\"ph codeph\">DISPLAY</code> statement and the expression\n            you use in the <code class=\"ph codeph\">ACCUM</code> function must be in exactly the same form. (For\n            example, &quot;on-hand * cost&quot; and &quot;cost * on-hand&quot; are not in exactly the same form.) For\n            the <code class=\"ph codeph\">AVERAGE</code>, <code class=\"ph codeph\">SUB-AVERAGE</code>, <code class=\"ph codeph\">TOTAL</code>, and\n              <code class=\"ph codeph\">SUB-TOTAL</code> aggregate phrases, <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var> must be numeric.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"ACCUM-function__example_GC152Z2679297\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d101926e254\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\nprocedure shows a total for the extended price of each item on an order.\nThe running total of the order is displayed as well as the order\ntotal and grand total for all orders. This procedure accumulates\ntotals at three levels.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-accum.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"ACCUM-function__idGDE1VY2661870\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>FOR EACH Order NO-LOCK:\n  DISPLAY Order.OrderNum Order.CustNum Order.OrderDate Order.PromiseDate\n    Order.ShipDate.\n  FOR EACH OrderLine OF Order NO-LOCK:\n    DISPLAY OrderLine.LineNum OrderLine.ItemNum OrderLine.Qty\n      OrderLine.Price (OrderLine.Qty * OrderLine.Price) LABEL &quot;Ext Price&quot;.\n    ACCUMULATE OrderLine.Qty * OrderLine.Price (TOTAL).\n    DISPLAY <strong class=\"ph b\">(ACCUM TOTAL OrderLine.Qty * OrderLine.Price)</strong> LABEL &quot;Accum Total&quot;.\n  END.\n  DISPLAY <strong class=\"ph b\">(ACCUM TOTAL OrderLine.Qty * OrderLine.Price)</strong> LABEL &quot;Total&quot;.\nEND.\nDISPLAY <strong class=\"ph b\">(ACCUM TOTAL OrderLine.Qty * OrderLine.Price)</strong> LABEL &quot;Grand Total&quot;\n  WITH ROW 1.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"ACCUM-function__see-also_GC15302679305\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d101926e298\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ACCUMULATE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ACCUMULATE-statement.html\">ACCUMULATE statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DISPLAY-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DISPLAY-statement.html\">DISPLAY statement</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ABSOLUTE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABSOLUTE-function.html\">ABSOLUTE function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ACCUMULATE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ACCUMULATE-statement.html\">ACCUMULATE statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/308801","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":597,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"ACCUM function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ACCUM-function.html","type":"Manual"}